{"parse": {"title": "FR-15", "pageid": 40853, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FR-14\" title=\"FR-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FR-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/FR-16\" title=\"FR-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.93.A6.E8.8D.89.E6.A0.B9.EF.BC.8C.E8.8D.89.E6.A0.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"哦草根，草根\">哦草根，草根</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 哦草根，草根</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">O, Grass-Roots</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>告<span class=\"color-value\"></span>诉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1810115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-618001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-618001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-618001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>噢——是你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-618001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-618001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-618001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>我想和你谈谈。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你来得正好，叶甫根尼同志，我找到了更详细的资料！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>它们在这儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌背过身去，开始翻找如山的资料堆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>相信我，这一定能解除你的顾虑……至少一小部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵冷冽的风突兀地袭来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>直入正题吧——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>我希望你能终止目前的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>开垦矿区已经让许多人受伤了，而这只是个开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>你能保证未来不会有人因此牺牲么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>你所称的新资源只是个未知数，而我们不得不为之支付高昂的代价……他们本应在更好的地方参与建设。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雨点密密麻麻地淋了下来，把北方哨歌浇了个通透。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我们会用更充分的知识武装自己……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>我理解你的诉求，为了你的理线学，是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>比起这儿只有满腔热情的门外汉，我为你找来了更合适的人选。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不紧不慢的脚步声踏入了房门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>很高兴见到你，北方哨歌女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>或者说，一位来自非正式学科的敏锐学者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的面庞显得真诚而惊喜，就像是他们从来没见过似的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你好，芝诺的大人物先生……不得不说，你的态度真让人受宠若惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方像是根本没意识到北方哨歌刻意的揶揄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>在叶甫根尼先生的强烈要求下，我向芝诺申请调阅了你的详细资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>芝诺追踪过许多神秘现象，也勘察过不少的神秘学环境，但从未见过对神秘现象的研究如此执着的年轻人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>那现在呢？……高高在上的大人物打算信任一门乡野学派了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝托尔特不置可否地笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>尽管我个人十分欣赏你的坚持，但暂时还不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我更好奇的是，遍布全世界的足迹为你和你的学派带来了什么收获吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的目光穿过北方哨歌，打量着她身后散落一地的资料与纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>说正事吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>感谢叶甫根尼同志吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一封崭新的推荐信递到了北方哨歌的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-618210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-618210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-618210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>尽管你的成果在芝诺看来并不足够，但叶甫根尼同志主动将自己的名额出让给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-618210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-618210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-618210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>在他的举荐下，你获得了一个难得的新机会——芝诺的试验场地，与知名学者的交流机会，一封正式的盖有芝诺印章的推荐信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的语气不紧不慢，仿佛胜券在握。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-618012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-618012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-618012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>我唯一的要求是……你能放弃这场不切实际的闹剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>真让人感激涕零……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>大家一起巴巴地望着，等着芝诺大发慈悲，为我们分好一个个去处，然后我们再为此滴下几滴热泪来，对么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>撇去你发言中那些情绪化的成分，我不认为这一选择有什么问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>相比于前赴后继地扑倒在可能性不大的矿区，让所有的精英都能走上正轨，这有什么问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝托尔特挑了挑眉，像是在宣布一条颠扑不破的社会真理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>那来亚什基呢……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方古怪地看了她几眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>对于一些过时之物而言，悄无声息的消失是最好的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>……当然，它们将会留在历史长河中的某个角落，不是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>无意冒犯，叶甫根尼先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>……如果得不到芝诺的帮助，我们显然无法解决当下的所有问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>只要找到新的资源，一切的问题都会迎刃而解——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>咳咳——你误会了，北方哨歌女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>这片土地对于芝诺的意义在于其中的神秘学家，而不是一个孤零零的空壳。送走所有的镇民后，我们便会将这儿彻底封闭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他终于露出了些许真实的愠怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>这是出于芝诺的责任感与危机意识，而非什么别的可能性，你明白了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌放下了那张凝聚着无数人心血的地脉能量图，什么也没说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>还是关注些更现实的问题吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>芝诺有许多出色的年轻人，有良好的环境……也有更好的未来。如果你能通过考核，你就能得到一个真正重振理线学的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手指按在那张信纸上，手指从新印的纹章上缓缓划过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根比之前更为甘甜与芳香的“胡萝卜”，它无声地倒映在北方哨歌的瞳孔中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在过去的许多时间里，她曾不止一次地想象过类似的画面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在幽闭而沉闷的地下室里，在薪水微薄的编辑社里，在无数促狭而冷冽的目光里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>这是为了你们所有人好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这位高不可攀的先生，放下你那被消费主义和精英主义彻底销蚀掉的脑袋瓜，你就没理解到点更高尚的原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我们不愿放弃这里，难道仅仅是因为对个人优渥生活的向往？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你们理所当然地踩着普通的人们跃升，将我们这样的草根芦苇视为理所当然的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你得面对这个残酷的现实，尽管是芝诺，我们也没法拯救所有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>倒不如说，这是一种社会运转中必然发生的自我优化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是的，就算找到了新的资源，他们也不得不面临着更贫乏的生活、更艰难的前路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>但那又如何呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她终于拾回了某种久违的勇敢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>精英主义的旗帜插满了一切随处可见的角落，但至少它还没能打败这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我理解你，草根学者大都保有如此朴素的认知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>他们不愿抛下任何一个同胞，不愿为个人的美好未来而放弃没能搭上新快艇的同胞们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>让各位前赴后继的并非理线学，也绝非某人的个人理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——而是千千万万个携手并进的夙愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>一个光明的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>至于这个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她卷起了那张精致的推荐信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我不再需要它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>呸——草根永远都是草根。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝托尔特丢下最后一句话，头也不回地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>揉皱的信轻飘飘地飞出了窗外，它落在窗外连绵的大雪中，消失得无影无踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切会变得更好么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌无暇他顾，她瘫坐在椅子上，大口地汲取着新新世界的空气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>……我很羡慕你的单纯，北方哨歌姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>在过去的许多年里，我也曾相信过我们是历史性的人物，肩负着改造世界的重大使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>当我抬头看的时候，新世界的大门已经关闭了。来亚什基在惯性中继续向前，我试图维护现在的一切……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>但我失败了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>来亚什基已经走上一条注定的路，与所有的努力无关，与我们是否有着坚决的意志无关。我们曾试图生产一个真正的、具有历史意义的东西，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叶甫根尼努力昂首，他的面庞隐没在灯光照不到的黑暗里，看不清表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>不仅是芝诺，对于整个世界而言，保守才是当今的主流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>现实正是这样，寡淡无味，了无生趣，令所有人失望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>场面一时间陷入了无言的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久，北方哨歌终于慢腾腾地直起身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她终于蜕去了沉甸甸的外壳，甩开了那颗本就不属于她的胡萝卜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你太悲观了，叶甫根尼同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>芝诺如此反常的积极招徕让我至少确定了一件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——他们不希望我们继续下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>他们努力地贬低我们，为来亚什基的灰暗前路而痛惜，为我们谋划了一条无比远大而光明的前程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>可哪怕有人负伤，甚至因此牺牲——他们也不愿意为来亚什基提供任何多余的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>难道高高在上的老爷们是出于慈悲的关怀，才如此迫切地希望我们停止探索吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>当然不是，我的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>就我这些年摸爬滚打得出的经验而言……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——永远别做让你的敌人满意的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她用力地拍了拍对方的肩膀，陌生而熟悉的狡黠又回到了她的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>芝诺在害怕我们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>他们害怕我们找到新的火种，害怕我们不受蛊惑，拥有只属于我们的、他们无法操控的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>可他们战胜不了我们——来亚什基是我们的，未来也是我们的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那团早已燃尽的灰似乎又冒出了些微火星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叶甫根尼神色复杂地昂起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶甫根尼：</div><div>我会慎重考虑你的看法，北方哨歌……同志。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FR-15"}}